### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Platform stats
GET http://localhost:4000/api/stats

### Top donors (platform)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/donors/top?limit=5

### Orgs directory
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orgs

### One org
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orgs/0

### Org stats
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orgs/0/stats

### Org donations
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orgs/0/donations?limit=10

### Org top donors
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orgs/0/donors/top

### Org milestones
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orgs/0/milestones

### Milestone metadata
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orgs/0/milestones/0/metadata

### Upsert metadata
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/orgs/0/milestones/0/metadata
Content-Type: application/json

{ "receiptUrl": "https://example.com/receipt.pdf", "notes": "Invoice #123" }
